WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.070
We intercepted a NUNS transmission.

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.930
The 47th Special Fleet seems to have been wiped out.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:07.690
Wiped out?!

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.590
Apparently their dimensional weapons were detonated on themselves.

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.750
Powerful bio-fold waves have been detected as well.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.820
The song of the stars, huh?

00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:18.480
All units stand by to fold!

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.790
Destination: Ragna!

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.470
Time for the final battle.

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:26.090
Jeez, I'm getting the jitters.

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:26.710
Freyja!

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:27.670
Hm?

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:32.880
Uh... I...

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:35.550
Oh.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:37.800
I...

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.210
Dammit!

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.660
Let's make it out of this mess alive.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:42.890
Let's go!

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:44.980
Hayate?

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.070
Hayate...

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:51.650
I've gotta go.

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:07.790
So this is the Star Sanctuary?

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:08.750
I know this place.

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:12.000
This is my stage.

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:18.760
I could feel the wind of tens of thousands of lives being extinguished. 

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:24.730
Is this the burden Father had to shoulder?

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.690
It is the fate of those who rule the stars.

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:30.550
Keith...

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:33.180
So everyone's been shouldering this weight?

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:35.440
From now on, I'll take part in it as well.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:36.360
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:39.860
But it is not my intention to needlessly spill blood.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:43.140
Now that they have witnessed the power of the song of the stars,

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:44.730
I will initiate peace talks.

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:46.210
Your Majesty?!

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:49.520
I will end this struggle once and for all.

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:53.130
I will now begin the preparations to launch.

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:56.730
Please forgive me for sitting on your throne,

00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:01.350
but commanding the Star Singer drains the controller's rune.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:03.870
Be cautious.

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:04.570
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:15.070
The wind is filling my body!

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:20.890
Mikumo?

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:23.490
I can feel her throbbing pain.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:25.910
It feels so lonely.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:30.990
For the galaxy,

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:32.440
for our loved ones,

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:35.090
for Makina and Mikumo's sake,

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.570
we will

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:38.760
burn white-hot

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.860
and have fun as if our lives depended on it!

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.260
Enemy fleet detected.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:45.010
Multiple vessels approaching!

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:47.470
Delta Leader to platoon.

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:50.240
Commence Operation Ragnarok!

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:52.020
Give 'em your best!

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:54.440
I'll take Ragna back!

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.280
Delta 4, how's your new plane?

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.150
Amazing.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:01.570
It's working really well with Messer's flight data.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.530
I'll show them I can fly without overthinking.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:07.240
Let's do this, Mirage.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:17.400
<i>If you can see the end of the sky</i>

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:23.390
<i>If you can hear my trembling voice</i>

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:29.390
<i>Then rise up like you would explode into pieces</i>

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:35.400
<i>Our torn memories will be our limitless wings</i>

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:38.710
<i>Remember what we talked about that day?</i>

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:40.620
<i>Remember how we used to...</i>

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:41.740
I'm with you, girls...

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:48.570
<i>We'll just rise up until we can relive the days</i>

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:53.410
<i>Break me; feel me closer and stronger</i>

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:51.900
Go!

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:56.380
<i>Hello? Are you there?</i>

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:01.420
<i>My life blooms on the battlefield, burning away</i>

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:05.640
<i>Kill me now before I dry up and die</i>

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:08.650
<i>I will flare up my entire existence</i>

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:17.610
<i>And make miracles happen under this suffocating sky</i>

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:25.360
<i>Inside this storm of emotions,</i>

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.590
Freyja... What happened?

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:31.700
<i>I feel like I'll forget who I really am</i>

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:28.660
Freyja Wion.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.730
Her wind is different now.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:37.830
<i>I'm being bombarded by worries and uncertainties</i>

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:33.640
As if her sunshine has been blocked by clouds.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:43.990
<i>The only way to win is to admit my weakness</i>

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:46.970
<i>If it weren't me</i>

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:45.380
White Knight.

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:47.640
Hayate Immelmann.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:50.140
<i>If it weren't you</i>

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.330
We are ready to launch.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:56.360
<i>I don't think we could've ever felt this way</i>

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:51.390
Your orders?

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:56.330
As the true king, I command:

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.150
Rudanjal Rom Mayan!

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.180
What is this?

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.250
This song...

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.180
No way!

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:37.440
Mikumo?

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:41.310
No way! Bio-fold waves amplifying exponentially!

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:43.440
That's the Star Singer?

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:22.650
Beautiful! The fold neural network is taking shape!

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:25.780
What is the meaning of this, Roid?

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:32.240
By synchronizing the minds of all humanoids, we will evolve into something greater.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:33.740
Evolve?

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:36.910
This is the true power of the song of the stars.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:40.420
All humanoids will be connected and evolve into a single greater being.

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:43.340
This should bring absolute peace to the galaxy.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:47.580
What?!

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:50.260
You want to betray His Majesty and Windermere?!

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:55.860
There is no betrayal in this.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:07:01.440
Humanoids will evolve into a galactic-scale lifeform akin to the Vajra.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:07.080
At the core of that will be us, 
Windermereans, who possess runes.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:13.130
By connecting billions of minds, our information processing speed will reach divine levels.

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:15.620
We will feel every moment as an eternity.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:22.290
We can be freed from the shackles of our fleeting lives and rule the galaxy forever.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.250
Roid!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:24.650
You bastard!

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:34.990
Freyja!

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:45.940
A new world is born!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.740
Life...

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:42.620
What have I—

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:46.330
Now you and I are one with the galaxy.

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:49.800
Let our voices resonate.

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:53.940
This is my life purpose.

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:09.400
<i>You were always left behind,</i>

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:12.300
<i>so you just watched...</i>

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:13.780
I must...

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:16.150
I must make my song reach them!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:20.630
<i>from where you stood</i>

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:19.690
Freyja!

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:20.990
Hayate!

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:29.300
<i>Counting the sacrifices it takes to achieve something...</i>

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:21.990
Freyja!

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:28.330
The wind of life!

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:39.360
His Majesty?!

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:41.480
Take out Roid?!

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:44.100
Work with Walküre?!

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:46.810
Do you want us to forgive them?!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.620
I do not ask that of you.

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:52.700
The UN Government must be dealt with eventually.

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:54.530
But this is our priority now!

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:56.740
That's Your Majesty's...

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.940
For the true wind,

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.990
take down Roid Brehm and protect the galaxy!

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:06.200
For the great wind!

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.040
Dammit!

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:14.130
Trying to maintain yourself is futile.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:25.240
Become one with me.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:26.570
United.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.060
Let me go!

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:34.060
I want to... protect... Freyja...

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:36.130
Freyja...

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:38.650
I...

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:46.010
I love you!

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:48.960
I'll protect you no matter what!

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:54.620
So make your song resonate across the galaxy!

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:57.590
Hayate...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:58.800
Hayate...

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.490
I—

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:05.640
Freyja...

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:08.780
Your hand...

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:11.270
Please don't tell anyone.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:15.650
I want to spend the little time I have left on stage.

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:19.280
I'm part of Walküre!

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:21.830
Freyja!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.510
Freyja!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:29.960
Hayate!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:31.040
I...

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.330
I love you!

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.790
I was born into a family of pilots.

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:43.300
I lived my life feeling that I must fly.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:49.430
But then I met you and by flying together, I came to realize

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:53.350
just how much I love flying.

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:57.770
I wish I could fly together with you forever.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:11:59.990
Mirage...

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.360
How long are you gonna keep silent, Freyja?!

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:08.200
You made me say all of that but you won't say a thing yourself?!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.890
You coward! Spineless!

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:12.570
Spoiled apple-girl!

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.420
Mirage?

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:28.050
I love you... I love you... I love you...

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.770
I love you!

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:34.940
Freyja!

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:39.360
I love you?

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:41.790
Be quiet!

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:44.090
Freyja!

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:44.740
Freyja!

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:52.880
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:56.200
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:12:56.200 --> 00:13:00.350
<i>Let's share a selfish kiss</i>

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.120
Freyja!

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:03.310
I love you when you fly!

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:05.880
I love you when you love flying!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.780
I love you too, Freyja!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:16.380
<i>The petals of this flower fall in the wind</i>

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:21.840
<i>The stars are more than I could count</i>

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:25.230
<i>I could place all the blame on you,</i>

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:26.080
Freyja!

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:28.130
<i>swallowing back my tears,</i>

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:27.320
Rune power rules!

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:32.790
<i>but I can't tell anyone about how my heart races</i>

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.260
Kaname! Reina!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.710
<i>(Reach out) Until it all breaks apart</i>

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.420
<i>(Reach out) Until you can take flight</i>

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:41.340
<i>(To the ends) Deep in my heart</i>

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.340
<i>(Of time) There is a prayer</i>

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:42.350
A song?

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:43.090
Walküre?

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:47.470
<i>Just feel, just believe</i>

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:45.580
This song?

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:46.800
It's the apple girl!

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:48.780
Why is my rune—

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:48.760
<i>and speed through it all</i>

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:51.310
Pew! Pew! Pew!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.740
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:57.450
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:56.300
This song...

00:13:57.450 --> 00:14:03.150
<i>Let's share a kiss faster than light, just wait for me</i>

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.930
<i>I'll leave my body behind</i>

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:04.770
What am I...

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:08.250
Don't be misled, Rudanjal Rom Mayan.

00:14:05.930 --> 00:14:08.660
<i>I'll leave my heart beating hard</i>

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:13.790
<i>I'll break free from these chains holding me down</i>

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:11.250
Rudanjal Rom Mayan!

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:13.790
Rudanjal Rom Mayan!

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:13.790
What?

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.500
Is this Lord Roid?!

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:20.510
<i>Just come get me, in my purest form</i>

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:18.920
Rudanjal Rom Mayan!

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:20.160
Mikumo?

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:20.880
Mikumo!

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:23.960
Move in! Rescue Mikumo!

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:28.390
<i>When the lightning scorches the heavens</i>

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.050
Aye, sir!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:25.670
Roger!

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:26.800
No need for orders!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:27.720
Watch your back!

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:33.760
<i>my passion flares up</i>

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.470
Don't let your guard down in all the excitement, you horny boy!

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.760
Oh, shut up, nosy girl!

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:39.970
<i>and I am reminded that heart and body are one</i>

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:39.390
Thanks, Mirage.

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:44.820
<i>It's a listlessness I can't describe</i>

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:41.860
Thank me later.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:51.280
<i>(We)... met (We) looked for each other</i>

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:49.750
Makina!

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:50.240
Yay!

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:53.020
I wanted to sing with you so much.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:56.410
<i>...bloomed (our) shining flower of fire</i>

00:14:56.410 --> 00:15:00.860
<i>Shoot through my heart with the light of stars</i>

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:58.290
Why won't you join me?!

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.920
<i>Bang! Bang! Bang!</i>

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.630
<i>Let's dance in your...</i>

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.550
Girls!

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:14.220
<i>Let's embrace and hold each higher up than the sky</i>

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:17.180
<i>False strength</i>

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:20.100
<i>Meaningless bonds</i>

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:24.980
<i>Cast it aside and live with me</i>

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:31.790
<i>Just take me, bind me, you can do it</i>

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:26.980
Mikumo!

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:30.610
I got to sing with Walküre,

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.330
I found the love of my life,

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:34.870
and my rune is so full of life!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.290
Mikumo, what kind of feelings do you put into your songs?

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.870
No... I...

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:44.750
I—

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:46.650
Music is love!

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:48.130
Music is hope!

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.590
Music is life!

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:51.300
Music is energy!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:54.590
Ever since I met all of you...

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.410
I just want to...

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:00.620
sing together!

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:04.190
Music is mystery!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:07.330
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.990
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:09.360
She revived.

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:10.300
Kumo-Kumo.

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:15.830
<i>Let's share a kiss faster than light, just wait for me</i>

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:11.290
Mikumo...

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:12.240
Mikumo!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.200
Walküre!

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:18.430
<i>I'll leave my body behind</i>

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.160
Backup?!

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:21.180
<i>I'll leave my heart beating hard</i>

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:21.540
Their... song?

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:26.650
<i>I'll break free from these chains holding me down</i>

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.390
Walküre!

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:26.210
He saved us?

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.290
Just this once!

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:29.550
<i>Just come get me, in my purest form</i>

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:32.260
<i>Let's dance in your dream</i>

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:35.300
<i>to our raging love</i>

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:34.510
Freyja!

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:35.930
Hayate!

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:40.770
<i>Let's embrace and hold each higher up than the sky</i>

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.770
<i>False strength</i>

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.440
<i>Meaningless bonds</i>

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:51.740
<i>Cast it aside and live with me</i>

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:58.160
<i>Just take me, bind me, you can do it</i>

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:07.790
<i>Our passionate love will shoot us into a super nova-like state</i>

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:13.720
<i>We can do this! No wounds can hold us back if we're together</i>

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.660
Go!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:16.470
<i>Charm me with your passion, pray to the heavens</i>

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:19.680
<i>Our super big bang will breathe life into a new genesis</i>

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:23.180
<i>We burn our lives for this fusion</i>

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:28.560
<i>We are in absolute zero</i>

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:26.850
Brace yourselves!

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:29.980
Aether Attack!

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:35.110
Keith...

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:56.460
<i>Can you hear our promise ringing with warmth?</i>

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:55.170
Mikumo!

00:17:56.460 --> 00:18:00.330
<i>We can't give up on us quite yet</i>

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:58.280
Freyja!

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:00.840
Hold on tight!

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:01.680
Sure!

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:07.230
<i>Persistence is our weakness, a mythological mystery</i>

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:02.890
Here we come!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:11.130
<i>Don't be afraid; just jump in and reunite</i>

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:14.480
<i>Your spark starts a chain reaction</i>

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:13.530
You're...

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:14.480
Keith?!

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:18.200
<i>Just feel me with your whole body</i>

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:17.480
Take the Star Singer!

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:18.200
What?

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.910
I'll stop the wind.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:22.780
<i>You'll become the dream I can't give up on</i>

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.120
White Knight...

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:29.220
<i>We come together dancing in love and glow like an electric arc</i>

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:25.080
Mikumo!

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:35.090
<i>I see you next to me as I wake up; you'll never leave my sight</i>

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:31.300
Why can't you understand?!

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.250
You must've felt the heavens too!

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:37.220
The eternity beyond our fleeting lives!

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:37.750
<i>But I can't keep my eyes open in this squall</i>

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:39.410
We could live forever!

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:41.200
<i>You leave behind a phantom legacy as your feelings rush through me</i>

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:44.140
The present is everything for me!

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:44.350
<i>It's calm inside this everlasting gap</i>

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:48.820
<i>Like vibration inside a vacuum</i>

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:08.290
In that moment, I felt the burning light of life.

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:12.520
You were the one who showed me that, Roid.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:14.790
I did?

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:33.610
Sir White Knight!

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:02.760
All forces: assess our damages.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:07.160
We shall return to Windermere the moment we are ready!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:07.920
Da.

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:08.850
Da!

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:18.520
Keith and Roid flew the skies of Windermere in the end.

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:29.470
We're back.

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.800
Yeah. The Ragnan skies.

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:33.940
Chuck!

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:39.590
Chuck!

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:42.880
Marianne!

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:52.240
Mikumo!

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:53.020
Kumo-Kumo!

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:57.920
Welcome back, Kumo-Kumo!

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:58.820
Welcome back.

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:01.560
Makina... Reina...

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:04.100
Kaname!

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:08.480
Welcome back, Mikumo.

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:11.950
Good to be back.

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:39.810
Hayate...

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:45.280
The sky is high

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:48.830
and your rune shines brightly.

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:56.040
The sea is blue.

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:59.020
The clouds are big.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:02.420
The mercats are soft and fluffy.

00:22:03.350 --> 00:22:05.080
The beach is white.

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:10.970
The wind is kind.

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:13.240
Hey...

00:22:19.010 --> 00:22:20.030
I...

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:25.940
We'll always be together.

00:22:35.740 --> 00:22:37.240
Better be ready.

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:46.060
<i>Our kiss will link us from one end to the other</i>

00:22:46.060 --> 00:22:53.310
<i>I love you and I can't forget the warmth of your face</i>

00:22:50.680 --> 00:22:53.310
Mission 26: Eternal Walküre

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:56.010
<i>I've caught your passage</i>

00:22:56.010 --> 00:22:59.510
